          {
            "not": {
              "star": [
                "地空",
                "地劫"
              ],
              "at": "same"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "對面遷移宮的廉貞化忌，多感情拖累，容易因此重情面而失原則。",
      "en": "Lian Zhen opposite you is in Obstruction, bringing emotional entanglements that can push loyalty above principle.",
      "pole": "重情面",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.星系59.7",
        "quote": "则多感情拖累，因而变得徇私"
      }
